    <briefdescription>
<para>Requirements on the geometry policy of a cell (e.g. Marmot::Discretizations::Cells::DisplacementCell). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A geometry policy must provide the types <computeroutput>XiSized</computeroutput> ( <formula id="38">$ n_\mathrm{dim} $</formula> vector), <computeroutput>NSized</computeroutput> ( <formula id="39">$ 1\times n_\mathrm{nodes} $</formula>) and <computeroutput>dNdXSized</computeroutput> ( <formula id="40">$ n_\mathrm{dim}\times n_\mathrm{nodes} $</formula>) and the methods <computeroutput>findReferenceCoordinate</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>N</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>dNdX</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>detJ</computeroutput> with the signatures of CellGeometry. The cells additionally call <computeroutput>isCoordinateInCell</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>getBoundingBox</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>getElementShape</computeroutput>, which the concept does not check. Implementations: <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_cells_1_1_lagrangian_cell_geometry" kindref="compound">Marmot::Discretizations::Cells::LagrangianCellGeometry</ref>, <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_cells_1_1_b_spline_cell_geometry" kindref="compound">Marmot::Discretizations::Cells::BSplineCellGeometry</ref>.</para>
